2 CONT 7. ALFEREZ REAL JUAN2 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO (JUAN-FRANCISCO1) 
2 CONT *was born 1607, and 
2 CONT *died Bef. 1664 in Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married (1) ISABEL GARCIA-DEL-VALLE, 
2 CONT **daughter of PEDRO DE-LOS-SANTOS-DE-ROJO-RUELAS and MARIA DEL VALLE-FLORES-DE-VALDEZ. She was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT **Notes for ISABEL GARCIA-DEL-VALLE: A.K.A. Isabel Flores.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JUAN MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO and ISABEL GARCIA-DEL-VALLE are:
2 CONT *1. 33. i. CATARINA3 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO, 
2 CONT **b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT *2. 33. CATARINA3 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO (JUAN2, JUAN-FRANCISCO1) 
2 CONT **was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. 
2 CONT **She met SERGEANT MAJOR JOSEPH DE MORALES-Y-RAMON, son of LUIS RAMON-DE-MORALES and JUANA DE TREVINO-QUINTANILLA-Y-SALAZAR. 
2 CONT ***He was born Abt. 1610, and died 1670 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Notes for SERGEANT MAJOR JOSEPH DE MORALES-Y-RAMON: Source: Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coahulia, y Nuevo Leon, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 70 and 103.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of CATARINA MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO and JOSEPH DE MORALES-Y-RAMON is:
2 CONT *1. 124. i. MAJOR DIEGO4 RAMON, 
2 CONT **b. 1641, Queretaro, Queretaro, Mexico; 
2 CONT **d. April 10, 1719, San Juan Bautista del Rio Grande, Presido del Norte, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT
