2 CONT
2 CONT i. NICOLASA5 XIMENEZ-DE-VALDEZ, b. Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; m. NICOLAS FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-Y-DUARTE, 03 May 1707, Santiago Apostol, Monclova, Coahuila, Mexico; b. 1680, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico; d. 06 Jun 1731, San Antonio, Bexa
