2 CONC  She married JOSEPH-LUIS-ANTONIO MENCHACA-FLORES. He was born Abt. 1698 in San Juan Bautista del Rio Grande , el Presido del Norte, Coahuila,Mexico, and died in San Antonio, Bexar County, Texas.
