2 CONT ii. CAPTAIN PEDRO-JOSEPH MENCHACA-URRUTIA, b. San Juan Bautista del Rio Grande ,Presido del Norte, Coahuila,Mexico; m. GRACIA LEAL-FLORES, 21 Dec 1757, San Fernando, San Antonio, Bexar County, Texas; b. San Antonio, Bexar County, 
2 CONC Texas.
