2 CONT 21. NICOLASA FLORES-Y-AYALA (MARCOS FLORES-DE-ABREGO-DE-LA-GARZA, PEDRO FLORES-DE-ABREGO, PEDRO) She married NICOLAS GONZALEZ-DE-OCHOA April 28, 1699 in Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of JOSEPH-DIEGO GONZALEZ-D
2 CONC E-QUINTANILLA and MARIA DE OCHOA-ELIZALDE. He was born 1677 in Cadereyta Jimenez, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
