1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From The Descendents of Don Juan Perez de Onate and Dona Osana Martinez de Gonzalez, Compiled by John D. Inclan
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/onate.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT AGUSTINA10 SAENZ-SALDIVAR (ANTONIA9 DE SALDIVAR-Y-SALINAS, AGUSTIN8 DE SALDIVAR-SOSA, VICENTE7 DE SALDIVAR-Y-REZA, ANA-MARIA-MAGDELENA6 SALDIVAR-ONATE-MENDOZA, VICENTE5 DE SALDIVAR-Y-ONATE, MARIA4 DE ONATE, JUAN3 PEREZ-DE-ONATE, C
2 CONC RISTOBAL2 PEREZ-DE-NARRIAHONDO, PEDRO1 DE BAEZA) 
2 CONT *was born 02 Apr 1681 in Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon,Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married CAPTAIN JUAN RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR-DE-LA-GARZA 1695, 
2 CONT **son of DIEGO RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR and MARIA-INES DE-LA-GARZA-GONZALEZ-HIDALGO. He was born 29 Nov 1668 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ***Notes for CAPTAIN JUAN RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR-DE-LA-GARZA: Mil Familias III by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 67.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of AGUSTINA SAENZ-SALDIVAR and JUAN RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR-DE-LA-GARZA are:
2 CONT *1. i. JUAN IGNACIO11 RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR-SAENZ, 
2 CONT **b. 21 Oct 1698, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *2. ii. GERTRUDIS RODRIGUEZ-MONTEMAYOR-SAENZ, 
2 CONT **b. 26 Sep 1708, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *3. iii. JUAN JAVIER RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR-SAENZ, 
2 CONT **b. 20 Jul 1710, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *4. iv. ANTONIO RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR-SAENZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1711, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. MARIA DE ARRIOLA-MUNGUIA, 03 May 1734, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *5. v. FRANCISCO JAVIER RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR-SAENZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1713; 
2 CONT **m. LUZGARDA MARTINEZ-NUNEZ, 13 Mar 1734, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *6. 155. vi. JUANA-FRANCISCA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR-SAENZ, 
2 CONT **b. 10 Feb 1716, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *7. 156. vii. CAPTAIN JUAN-DIEGO RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR-SAENZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1718.
2 CONT *8. 157. viii. JUAN-FRANCISCO RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR-SAENZ, 
2 CONT **b. 1720.
