2 CONT 18. MARGARITA-GERTRUDIS4 GUTIERREZ-DE-CASTRO (GERTRUDIS3 DE-LA-GARZA, PEDRO2 FLORES-DE-ABREGO, PEDRO1) was born June 23, 1675 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. She married ALFEREZ JOSEPH MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-DE-LA-GARZA September 20,
2 CONC  1693 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of JOSEPH MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO and NICOLASA DE-LA-GARZA-DE-LA-ROCHA. He was born August 24, 1668 in Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
