2 CONT ISABEL4 GUTIERREZ-DE-LA-GARZA-FLORES (GERTRUDIS3 DE-LA-GARZA, PEDRO2 FLORES-DE-ABREGO, PEDRO1) was born 1690 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. She married JUAN TREMINO-SALDIVAR November 29, 1707 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, s
2 CONC on of JUAN DE TREMINO-DIAZ-NAVARRO and JOSEFA DE SOSA. He was born March 29, 1682 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for JUAN TREMINO-SALDIVAR: In the book, Mil Familias III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza, he is listed as a descendent of the Don Alonso of Estrada, The Duke of Aragon. Page 37.
2 CONT
2 CONT Also, a descendent of the Onate-Zaldivar family of Zacatecas and New Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for ISABEL GUTIERREZ-DE-LA-GARZA-FLORES and JUAN TREMINO-SALDIVAR:
2 CONT
2 CONT Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 195.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ISABEL GUTIERREZ-DE-LA-GARZA-FLORES and JUAN TREMINO-SALDIVAR are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. JOAQUIN5 TREVINO-GUTIERREZ, m. FRANCISCA SAENZ-FLORES, September 17, 1751, San Jose, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. DIEGO TREVINO-GUTIERREZ, b. February 16, 1712/13, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. LUCRECIA RODRIGUEZ-CHAPA, January 23, 1742, Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. ANA MARIA EFIGENIA TREVINO-GUTIERREZ, b. 1717; m. MARTIN FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-DEL-BOSQUE, August 08, 1737, Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
