2 CONT  ============================  194. ANA-MARIA6 RAMON-CEPEDA (FRANCISCA-XAVIERA5 DE CEPEDA-Y-VALLE, JUANA4 GARCIA-FLORES-DE-VALDEZ, PEDRO3 DE-LOS-SANTOS-DE-ROJO-RUELAS, BERNARDO2 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, JUAN1 DE CALIZ) was born July 20,
2 CONC  1709 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico. She married PEDRO-TORIBIO LOBO-GUERRERO September 12, 1730 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, son of ANTONIO LOBO-GUERRERO-DE-LAS-CASAS and ANA DE LIZARRARAS-Y-CUELLAR. He w
2 CONC as born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
