2 CONT Marriage Notes for ANA-MARIA RAMON-CEPEDA and PEDRO-TORIBIO LOBO-GUERRERO: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez., and Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 22.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ANA-MARIA RAMON-CEPEDA and PEDRO-TORIBIO LOBO-GUERRERO are:
2 CONT
