2 CONT iv. JOSEPH-JOAQUIN LOBO-GUERRERO-RAMON, b. March 14, 1739/40, Sagrario Metropolitano, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; m. JUANA-GERTRUDIS GOMEZ, February 06, 1769, Sagrario Metro, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT
