2 CONT ===============================
2 CONT 17. DIEGO UBERIO5 DE VILLARREAL (JOSEPH4 VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, DIEGO3 DE VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS, DIEGO2 DE VILLARREAL, FRANCISCO1 VILLARREAL) He married MARIA-ANA GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL April 08, 1720 in Sagrario Metro,
2 CONC  Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of MANUEL GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY and ANA DE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA. She was born 1700.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of DIEGO DE VILLARREAL and MARIA-ANA GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. DIEGO-RUTILO6 DE VILLARREAL-GONZALEZ, m. MARIA-GERTRUDIS GALINDO, Nuestra Senora de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. INES DE VILLARREAL-GONZALEZ, m. JOSEPH-BALTHAZAR DE CARDENAS-GONZALEZ, April 15, 1747, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for INES DE VILLARREAL-GONZALEZ and JOSEPH-BALTHAZAR DE CARDENAS-GONZALEZ:
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage source:From the book, Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 115.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. JOSEPH-FRANCISCO DE VILLARREAL, b. January 17, 1722/23, Nuestra Senora de Guadalupe Salinas Victoria, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. ANTONIA MARGARITA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON, January 29, 1753, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mex
2 CONC ico; b. 1734, Pesqueria Grande, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for JOSEPH-FRANCISCO DE VILLARREAL and ANTONIA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON:
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage source:Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerrera,
2 CONT
2 CONT Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. 1751 - 1779. Page 41.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. BLAS-ESTEBAN DE VILLARREAL-GONZALEZ, b. January 12, 1727/28, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT v. MIGUEL DE VILLARREAL-GONZALEZ, m. ANA-FRANCISCA GONZALEZ; b. 1750.
