1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Marriage to Maria Gerturdis de la Garza, c. 1728:
2 CONT
2 CONT  iii. JOSEPH-BERNARDO VILLARREAL-FLORES, b. 1700; m. MARIA-GERTRUDIS DE-LA-GARZA, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. INDEX TO THE MARRIAGE INVESTIGATIONS OF THE DIOCESE OF GUADALJARA, pp.43 Raul J Guerra et al.
2 CONT
2 CONT Not to be confused with his YOUNGER BROTHER  Bernardo Antonio de Villarreal Flores.
2 CONT
2 CONT FYI: 1. CAPTAIN JUAN3 DE VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS (DIEGO2 DE VILLARREAL, FRANCISCO1 VILLARREAL) was born 1638 in Valle de Salinas, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married (1) JUANA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-Y-GARCIA, daughter of FRANCISCO DE-LA-GA
2 CONC RZA-FALCON-TREVINO and JUANA GUTIERREZ-DE-LARA-GARCIA. She was born 1642 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. Notes for CAPTAIN JUAN DE VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS: Founder of the silver mine at Boca de Leones, Villaldama, Nuevo Leon, Me
2 CONC xico. Children of JUAN DE VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS and JUANA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-Y-GARCIA are: 2. i. PETRONILA4 DE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, b. Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. ii. LUCAS VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, b. February 28, 16
2 CONC 68/69, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 3. iii. CAPTAIN FRANCISCO DE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, b. March 09, 1668/69; d. Abt. 1723, Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 4. iv. MARCOS VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1670, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONC v. JUAN VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1672, Valle de las Salinas, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. MARIA DE-LA-GARZA-RENTERIA-SEPULVEDA, August 16, 1692, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1674, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. Ju
2 CONC ly 08, 1715, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 5. vi. ANA DE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1674, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. vii. DIEGO VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, b. October 06, 1674, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. (1) 
2 CONC BERNARDA TREVINO-RENTERIA, 1700; b. Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. (2) MARGARITA DE-LA-MOTA, January 19, 1700/01, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1682, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. Notes for BERNARDA TREVINO-RENTERIA: A.K.A
2 CONC . Bernarda de Sepulveda. 6. viii. FRANCISCA DE-LA-GARZA-VILLARREAL, b. Abt. 1675. ix. MATHEO VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1678, Valle de las Salinas, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. APOLONIA GONZALEZ-DE-LA-GARZA, September 18, 1698, Saltillo
2 CONC , Coahuila, Mexico; b. 1671, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; d. Abt. 1709, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico. Notes for APOLONIA GONZALEZ-DE-LA-GARZA: She signed her last will and testament in 1709. 7. x. MARIA DE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 
2 CONC 1666, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. WFT Est. 1693-1761, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. Child of CAPTAIN JUAN DE VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS is: 8. xi. GABRIEL4 DE VILLARREAL, b. 1662, Valle de las Salinas, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.  
2 CONT
