2 CONC NATE, JUAN3 PEREZ-DE-ONATE, CRISTOBAL2 PEREZ-DE-NARRIAHONDO, PEDRO1 DE BAEZA)31 
2 CONT *was born 1740 in Vallecillo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married (1) JOSEFA SANCHEZ-VILLARREAL 21 Nov 1753 in San Jose, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT **She was born in Vallecillo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married (2) MARIA-CATARINA MEDINA-Y-PINA 22 Jul 1761 in San Jose, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **daughter of PEDRO MEDINA-DE-LA-CALANCHA and MARIA-RITA DE PINA. She was born 1743.
2 CONT ***Notes for JUAN-DIEGO SAENZ-GARCIA: Mil Familias III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza. Page 73. Source on his marriage is from the Index to the marriage investigations of the Diocese of Guadajara, Provinces of Coahulia, Nuevo Le
2 CONC on, Nuevo Santander, Texas.
2 CONT ***Notes for MARIA-CATARINA MEDINA-Y-PINA: A.K.A Catalina Medina Calancha Pena
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JUAN-DIEGO SAENZ-GARCIA and JOSEFA SANCHEZ-VILLARREAL are:
2 CONT *1. 306. i. MARIA-CANDALARIA12 SAENZ-SANCHEZ.
2 CONT *2. ii. MARIA-LUISA SAENZ-SANCHEZ, 
2 CONT **m. JOSE-SOLOMON DE-LA-GARZA, 21 Apr 1770, San Jose, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
