1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 17. JUAN-ESTEBAN5 GALINDO-AGUIRRE (JUAN-JOSE4 GALINDO-DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, JUAN3 GALINDO-NAVARRO, JUAN2 GALINDO-MORALES, JOSE1 GALINDO) was born January 10, 1715 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, and died Abt. 1770 in B
2 CONC oca de Leones, Villaldama, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married (1) MARGARITA FERNANDEZ-CANTU. She was born 1752 in Boca de Leones, Villaldama, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married (2) MARIA-ROSA DE VILLARREAL-TREVINO November 29, 1735 in Boc
2 CONC a de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of PEDRO VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA and GERTRUDIS TREVINO-GUTIERREZ. She was born 1716 in Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died in Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JUAN-ESTEBAN GALINDO-AGUIRRE and MARIA-ROSA DE VILLARREAL-TREVINO are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. ANA-MARIA6 GALINDO-VILLARREAL.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. FRANCISCO-IGNACIO GALINDO-VILLARREAL.
2 CONT
2 CONT 23. iii. JUANA-MANUELA-JOSEFA GALINDO-VILLARREAL.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. JUAN-ESTEBAN GALINDO-VILLARREAL.
2 CONT
2 CONT 24. v. MARIA-DE-LA-ENCARNACION GALINDO-VILLARREAL.
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. MARIA-GERTRUDIS GALINDO-VILLARREAL, m. JOSE BERNARDO LOZANO-RODRIGUEZ, September 06, 1779, San Jose, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT vii. MARIA-THERESA-DE-JESUS GALINDO-VILLARREAL, m. PRUDENCIO GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL, January 07, 1772, San Pedro, Boca de Leones, Villaldama, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1740.
2 CONT
2 CONT viii. PEDRO GALINDO-VILLARREAL.
2 CONT
2 CONT ix. PEDRO-JOSE GALINDO-VILLARREAL.
2 CONT
2 CONT 25. x. ROSA GALINDO-VILLARREAL.
2 CONT
2 CONT xi. VALENTIN GALINDO-VILLARREAL, b. Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. Aft. January 18, 1815, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. MARIA-JOSEFA DE-LA-PENA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for VALENTIN GALINDO-VILLARREAL:
2 CONT
2 CONT He signed his last will and testament on January 1, 1815. Source:246 Testamentos de Monterrey, by
2 CONT
2 CONT Lilia E. Villanueva de Cavazos.
2 CONT
2 CONT 26. xii. MARIA-ANTONIA-LORETO-CORNELIA GALINDO-VILLARREAL, b. September 19, 1740, La Asuncion, Mexico, D.F., Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 27. xiii. MARIA-JOSEFA-DE-LOS-NIEVEZ GALINDO-VILLARREAL, b. 1746.
2 CONT
