2 CONT Tamaulipas, Mexico, son of 118. Jose Julian FLORES and 119. Maria Teresa RAMIREZ. He married 81. Maria
2 CONT Rafaela Balvina GARCIA, christened 9 Apr 1786 in Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico, died 26 Nov 1838 in Mier,
2 CONT Tamaulipas, Mexico, daughter of 120. Jose Antonio GARCIA and 121. Maria Gertrudis FLORES.
2 CONT Children of Jose Ventura FLORES and Maria Rafaela Balvina GARCIA were as follows:
2 CONT i Jose Nicodemus7 FLORES, christened 20 Dec 1802 in Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico. He
2 CONT married (1) on 4 Jun 1828 in Matamoros, Tamaulipas, Mexico Florentina CASTILLO,
2 CONT daughter of Polito CASTILLO and Monica GLORIA; (2) on 5 Dec 1832 in Mier, Tamaulipas,
2 CONT Mexico Maria Cecilia RODRIGUEZ, christened 25 Nov 1810 in Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico,
2 CONT died 5 Mar 1853 in Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico, daughter of Jose Ignacio RODRIGUEZ and
2 CONT Maria Marta GARCIA; (3) on 16 Feb 1855 in Roma, Starr County, Texas Crispina
