2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Request for information:
2 CONT
2 CONT MY GREAT GRANDFATHER AND GREAT GRANDMOTHER ARE PABLO GONZALEZ, BORN 1864 AND LEOCADIA(LOCARIA) GARZA BORN 1868
2 CONT
2 CONT THEY ARE BOTH FROM THE RIO GRANDE CITY/ROMA, TEXAS AREA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT THEY WERE MARRIED IN RIO GRANDE CITY, TEXAS ON MARCH 25, 1883. 
2 CONT
2 CONT I HAVE THE RECORD OF THEIR MARRIAGE CERTIFICATE. HER PARENTS NAMES ARE  FERMIN GARZA AND REYES SALAZAR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT PABLO GONZALEZ'S PARENTS NAMES  ARE MANUEL GONZALEZ BORN 1824 AND JOAQUINA BARRERA BORN 1829. 
2 CONT
2 CONT I HAVE NOT BEEN ABLE TO FIND THE PARENTS OF PABLO GONZALEZ AND  JOAQUINA BARRERA THUS FAR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sincerely,  Raul Gonzalez-Rodriguez 
