1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maria Clara de CHAPA [433] 
2 CONT *was born in 1702 in Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, New Spain.[430] 
2 CONT *She died before 1750 at the age of 48. 
2 CONT *Parents: Nicolas CHAPA and Ynes BAEZ DE BENAVIDES.
2 CONT *Spouse: Juan Diego LONGORIA Garcia. Maria Clara de CHAPA and Juan Diego LONGORIA Garcia were married on 30 July 1718 in Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, New Spain.[433] 
2 CONT *The Camargo Census of May 31, 1750, showed Diego Longoria as a widower. Children living in his household at that time were 
2 CONT **1. Antonio (30), 
2 CONT **2. Anna Maria (20), 
2 CONT **3. Juana Rosa (20), 
2 CONT **4. Joseph Vicente (18), 
2 CONT **5. Juana Anastacia (18), 
2 CONT **6. Pedro (17), and 
2 CONT **7. Petra (16). 
2 CONT *The Census indicated that he had "todas armas" (all arms) and that his assets included "setecientos cabezas de ganado de pelo y lana [700 head of goats and sheep], sesenta bestias caballares de cria [60 mules? for breeding], ocho
2 CONC  caballos mansos [8 tame horses], [and] cuatro bacas paridas [4 cows with calves]". 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children were: 
2 CONT *1. Maria Agustina LONGORIA Garcia, 
2 CONT *2. Maria Agueda LONGORIA Chapa, 
2 CONT *3. Jose Antonio LONGORIA Chapa, 
2 CONT *4. Tomas LONGORIA Chapa, 
2 CONT *5. Jose Matias LONGORIA Chapa, 
2 CONT *6. Maria Gertrudis LONGORIA Chapa, 
2 CONT *7. Ana Maria LONGORIA Chapa, 
2 CONT *8. Juana Rosa LONGORIA Chapa, 
2 CONT *9. Jose Vicente LONGORIA Chapa, 
2 CONT *10. Juana Anastacia LONGORIA Chapa, 
2 CONT *11. Pedro LONGORIA Chapa, 
2 CONT *12. Petra LONGORIA Chapa.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b41.html#P23
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Maria3 Chapa Benavides 
2 CONT *(Nicolas2 Chapa Treviño, Juan Bautista Schiapapria1 Chapa) was born Abt 1698 in Monterrey . 
2 CONT *She married Joseph Longoria García Abt 1713 in Nuevo Leon, 
2 CONT **son of Pedro Longoria Rodriguez and Agustina García de Quintanilla. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Maria Chapa Benavides and Joseph Longoria García are:
2 CONT *1. + 13 i. Maria Rosa4 Longoria, 
2 CONT **born Abt 1715 in Cerralvo .
2 CONT *2. + 14 ii. Joseph Santiago Longoria, 
2 CONT **born Abt 1730 in Cerralvo ; 
2 CONT **died Abt 1820 in Matamoros, Tamaulipas.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://longoriaf.tripod.com/Chapa.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT ===========================
2 CONT
2 CONT Clara Maria Chapa (0326) 
2 CONT *is the legitimate daughter of Nicolas Chapa (0206) and Inez Benavides Flores. 
2 CONT *Clara married Juan Diego Longoria Garcia circa 1718. The following children of this union were provided by Nick Hinojosa, 1712 Woolfe, Galena Park, Tx 77547.
2 CONT *1. Circa 1718 Antonio Longoria (0426)
2 CONT *2. Circa 1725 Jose Matias Longoria (0425) who married Maria Margarita Hinojosa.
2 CONT *3. Circa 1730 Ana Maria Longoria (0427)
2 CONT *4. Jan 8 1735 Juana Rosa Longoria (0428) who married Francisco Xavier Salinas. Marriage Investigations , #24-5, 8 Jan. 1735.
2 CONT *5. Circa 1732 Jose Vicente Longoria (0429)
2 CONT *6. Circa 1732 Juana Anastacia Longoria (0430)
2 CONT *7. Circa 1733 Pedro Longoria (0431) who married Josefa Villarreal.
2 CONT *8. Circa 1734 Petra Longoria (0432)
2 CONT *9. 1735/09/22 Maria Agueda de Longoria (0433) who married Salvador Vela. Salvador Vela is the son of Francisco Vela and Francisca Olivaries. Marriage Investigations, p-95.
2 CONT
2 CONT Garmendia Leal lists a possible 2nd marriage or the first marriage under slightly different names.
2 CONT *(1) Maria de Chapa married Joseph Longoria
2 CONT *(2) Clara de Chapa married Diego de Longoria
2 CONT
2 CONT I believe the above couples are one and the same. Consider Clara Maria de Chapa marrying Juan/Joseph Diego Longoria. If this assumption is true, they had at least 12 children.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://genforum.genealogy.com/longoria/messages/524.html
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
