2 CONC UAN3 PEREZ-DE-ONATE, CRISTOBAL2 PEREZ-DE-NARRIAHONDO, PEDRO1 DE BAEZA) was born 23 Jan 1678 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died in Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. Hemarried CLARA-MARIA CHAPA-BENAVIDES 30 Jul 1718 in Cerralvo,
2 CONC  Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of JOSE-NICOLAS CHAPA-TREVINO and MARIA-INEZ BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES-Y-FLORES. She was born in Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon,Mexico, and died in Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon,Mexico.
