2 CONT ===================
2 CONT
2 CONT Miguel Eusebio Chapa (0327) 
2 CONT *is the legitimate son of Nicolas Chapa (0206) and Maria Inez Benavides Flores. 
2 CONT *Miguel married Ana Maria Garcia (Ref: Marriage Investigations #24-31) on 24 May 1735.
2 CONT **Ana Maria Garcia is the daughter of Francisco Garcia and Maria Gertrudis Guajardo. 
2 CONT *Miguel Eusebio died before 1747. 
2 CONT *At least two children were born of this union.
2 CONT **In April 1747, Bartolome de Trevino married Ana Maria Garcia - widower of Miguel Chapa (0327). Marriage Investigations, #28-21, p-117.
2 CONT **1764 Aug. 15 Miguel Chapa (0465) who married Rosa Maria Trevino at Camargo.
2 CONT **1803 Feb. 15 Nicolas Joseph Chapa (0466), widower of Maria Gertrudis Romero, died at Camargo.
2 CONT
