1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Juan Bautista Chapa (0321) 
2 CONT *is the legitimate son of Nicolas Chapa (0206) and Inez Benavides Flores. 
2 CONT *Juan Bautista Chapa married Rita Lopez de Jean on January 19, 1740, at Cadereyta, Nuevo Leon. 
2 CONT *Juan Bautista Chapa is listed in the May 31, 1750, census of Camargo, Tamaulipas with four children.
2 CONT *The children Jose Francisco Chapa (0450) and Maria Antonia Gertrudis Chapa (0451) were found in the Mier Marriage Records. The rest of the children are named on page 99 of Herrera Perez's "Anales y Testimonios del Cantaro".
2 CONT *1. 1753 age 12 Maria Josefa Chapa (0453) 
2 CONT **Juan Bautista Chapa and Ma. Rita Lopez
2 CONT *2. 1753 age 9 Maria Gregoria Chapa (0454) 
2 CONT **Juan Bautista Chapa and Ma. Rita Lopez
2 CONT *3. 1753 age 2 Maria Ignacia Chapa (0455) 
