1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Florencio Chapa (0320) 
2 CONT *was born circa 1714, the legitimate son of Nicolas Chapa (0206) and Inez Benavides Flores. 
2 CONT *Florencio Chapa married Margarita de la Pena circa 1735. 
2 CONT *Captain Jose Florencio Chapa was in charge of the founding of the town of Mier on March 6, 1757. 
2 CONT *Florencio died April 13, 1786, in Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon. 
2 CONT *One child of this union, Joaquin Chapa, was located in the Guerrero Marriage Records and the other children are found in the Mier Marriage and Death records.
