1 NOTE {geni:about_me} UPDATE: DNA MATCH THAT SHE IS THE SISTER OF RAFAEL GARCIA, SON OF JUAN JOSE GARCIA. SHE IS IGNACIA CRISANTA. '''Family Tree Book (The F. W. Seabury Papers), a transcription of the original papers in The Center for 
2 CONC American History at The University of Texas at Austin, transcribed and edited by Joel Rene Escobar, New Santander Press, Edinburg, TX, 1995, page109. Ignacia did not reveal her parentage to Seabury during his genealogical intervie
2 CONC ws. I've come to believe she did not want to reveal the close interpersonal relationship with the Garcia family. Her birth records were located confirming her parentage and as being the sister to Rafael Garcia. The story of their 
2 CONC family is told in the parable El Mesquite written by their descendant Elena Zamora O'Shea. This parable is a loving remembrance of the lost culture of the ranching families of south Texas. 
2 CONT --------------------
