1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 21. JOSEPH-JAVIER5 CHAPA-GUAJARDO (AUGUSTIN-FRANCISCO-JAVIER4 CHAPA-DE-LA-BARRERA, JOSEPH-MARIA3 CHAPA-TREVINO, JUAN BAUTISTA2 CHAPA, BARTOLOME1 SCHIAPAPRIA) was born 25 Mar 1738 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterre
2 CONC y, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married (1) JOSEFA DE-LA-GARZA 1759. He married (2) MARIA-JOSEFA SAUCEDO-GUZMAN 06 Jul 1760 in Nuestra Sra de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of CRISTOBAL SAUCEDO and ROMANA GUZM
2 CONC AN.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JOSEPH-JAVIER CHAPA-GUAJARDO and JOSEFA DE-LA-GARZA are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 42. i. JOSE-ANTONIO6 CHAPA-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1764.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. JUAN-JOSE CHAPA-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1771; m. MARIA-GERTRUDIS GUERRA-FLORES, 12 Aug 1791, San Jose, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 42. JOSE-ANTONIO6 CHAPA-DE-LA-GARZA (JOSEPH-JAVIER5 CHAPA-GUAJARDO, AUGUSTIN-FRANCISCO-JAVIER4 CHAPA-DE-LA-BARRERA, JOSEPH-MARIA3 CHAPA-TREVINO, JUAN BAUTISTA2 CHAPA, BARTOLOME1 SCHIAPAPRIA) was born 1764. He married (1) MARIA-ENC
2 CONC ARNACION DE-LA-BARRERA-ROBLES 07 Jan 1784 in San Jose, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of JOSE-ANTONIO DE-LA-BARRERA and MARIA-ANTONIA ROBLES. She died 03 Jun 1829 in Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married (
2 CONC 2) MARIA-CECELIA FLORES-TREVINO 23 May 1831 in San Jose, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of NICOLAS FLORES and ANA-MARIA TREVINO. She was born in Vallecillo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JOSE-ANTONIO CHAPA-DE-LA-GARZA and MARIA-ENCARNACION DE-LA-BARRERA-ROBLES are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 105. i. MARIA-JUANA7 CHAPA-DE-LA-BARRERA, b. San Juan Bautista, Lampazos de Naranjo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 106. ii. JOSE-BRUNO CHAPA-DE-LA-BARRERA, b. 21 Oct 1784, San Jose, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 107. iii. MARIA-URSULA CHAPA-DE-LA-BARRERA, b. 01 Nov 1786, San Jose, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. MARIA-PAULA CHAPA-DE-LA-BARRERA, b. 12 Nov 1786, San Jose, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 108. v. MARIA-LUISA CHAPA-DE-LA-BARRERA, b. 04 Sep 1788, San Juan Bautista, Lampazos de Naranjo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 109. vi. JOSE-AGAPITO CHAPA-DE-LA-BARRERA, b. 07 Oct 1794, San Jose, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 110. vii. JOSE ANTONIO CHAPA-DE-LA-BARRERA, b. 25 Jan 1795, San Jose, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 111. viii. JOSE-DIONICIO CHAPA-DE-LA-BARRERA, b. 14 Mar 1798, San Jose, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 112. ix. JOSE-JULIAN CHAPA-DE-LA-BARRERA, b. 08 Mar 1800, San Jose, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT x. INFANT CHAPA-DE-LA-BARRERA, b. 1804, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. 20 Aug 1804, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 113. xi. JOSE-PAULINO CHAPA-DE-LA-BARRERA, b. 27 Jun 1807, Sabinas Hidalgo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/chapa.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Jose Antonio Chapa (5420) and Maria Encarnacion Barrera were married January 7, 1784, according to an LDS microfilm index of the CHAPA baptisms and marriages in Nuevo Leon. The same index lists them as the parents of nine children
2 CONC . Assuming that a man normally marries around twenty, Jose Antonio Chapa (5420) would have been born circa 1764.
2 CONT
2 CONT Reviewing my CHAPA databank for a Jose Antonio Chapa born around 1764, I found only one other that could possibly be same man. Jose Antonio Chapa (0503) the son of Jose Xavier Chapa and Maria Josefa Saucedo, married Maria del Refu
2 CONC gio Salinas on January 27, 1783, at Cerralvo. This marriage produced at least seven children so he could not possibly marry Maria Encarnacion in 1784.
2 CONT
2 CONT LDS film # 1162851 is a secondary document. After the turn of the twentieth century, Mexico had a project to copy their old baptism, marriage, and death records. Men were hired to catalogue and abstract those old records. There ar
2 CONC e many mistakes in the transcriptions and when question arise one should consult the primary document if at all possible. Note that the secondary record indicates that the parents of Jose Antonio Chapa (5420) are Javier Chapa and 
2 CONC Josefa de la Garza. Javier and Xavier is a spelling variation. Marie Josefa Saucedo and Josefa de la Garza could be an error in the surnames. The match of the mother's given name, the same father, and a close agreement on birthday
2 CONC s leads me to conclude that Jose Antonio Chapa (5420) and (0503) are one and the same, however, the marriage data above prevents that conclusion.
2 CONT
2 CONT Further, Jose Xavier Chapa (0400) the son of Agustin Xavier Chapa (0300) and Antonia Margarita Guajardo could not have been married to a Josefa de la Garza since his children with Maria Josefa Saucedo were born between 1760 and 17
2 CONC 80. Josefa de la Garza's son, Jose Antonio Chapa, was born circa 1764.
2 CONT
2 CONT If I now assume that the mother's name, Maria Josefa de la Garza, is correct I can find only one marriage to a Jose Gregorio Chapa (2510). They did have a son Jose Antonio Chapa (2661) who was born in August 23, 1761 and could pos
2 CONC sibly marry Maria Encarnacion Barrera 23 years later. This assumption requires that an error in the father's given name was recorded. I am not ready to make this leap yet.
2 CONT
2 CONT Norman P. Brown
2 CONT  October 1, 1990
2 CONT
2 CONT  http://genforum.genealogy.com/longoria/messages/524.html
